{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Together After Dark is a 4-player co-op horror experience that will take you on chilling journey into the unknown together with your friends. Dive deep into a dark and dangerous forest filled with unsettling mysteries, malevolent energies.<br><br>Immerse yourselves in the chilling atmosphere:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2708790/extras/52bc98090efd6b6dedf93b6bdafa5c45.poster.avif?t=1737334097\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2708790/extras/52bc98090efd6b6dedf93b6bdafa5c45.webm?t=1737334097\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2708790/extras/52bc98090efd6b6dedf93b6bdafa5c45.mp4?t=1737334097\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br>Walk through treacherous paths all covered in darkness and every rustle of the leaves or snap of a twig will feed your fear.<br>Witness spooky paranormal events that will make you doubt your mind.<br>Enjoy the excitement of camaraderie as you depend on one another to prevail over what lies ahead in terms of challenges and horrors.<br><br><br>Beyond the haunting atmosphere and chilling encounters lies a crucial task: It is necessary to find a way out without being seen.<br><br>Together After Dark provides a memorable tour of horror enthusiasts who are looking for an exciting and bloody journey with their friends.<br><br>Key Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4-player co-op horror experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hauntingly beautiful and atmospheric environment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chilling paranormal encounters and jump scares</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unravel the dark secrets hidden within the forest</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you brave enough to face the darkness?</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Altar Sacrifice","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2708790/13037473f77aa165c485c47b8b01735b14a1ab39.jpg"},{"name":"Everyone\u2019s Dead","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2708790/80cad79377bbbb4239a433d2fdc4683daf30ea3f.jpg"},{"name":"Face the Ghost","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2708790/2f298fcaf5e1501819a790710e3a002faadc5ba3.jpg"},{"name":"First Jump Scare","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2708790/ade16963e21aa6ddd56292e70f49c0e32a7f9fce.jpg"},{"name":"First Steps","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2708790/4930f3dce74efe4b13d0f3dd8a0fc93d927c128c.jpg"},{"name":"Four Survivors","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2708790/940e6d6b65b395d8c79977cd2ad5e64e112b2abc.jpg"},{"name":"Last Survivor","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2708790/c641e37509e4cce208d538ddfca2fff5eb0492c1.jpg"},{"name":"Pathfinder","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2708790/f0dfc961b527149bc380b2c9e150e22967b10edd.jpg"},{"name":"Rat Bite","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2708790/e9f7fd3501f3ef0437483773f0bf8ea5fd50c025.jpg"},{"name":"Something Is Hunting Us","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2708790/0da9c8b1b4dfd873914880417ab5bf4790a84eed.jpg"}],"total":10},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2708790?t=1737334097","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2708790/