 a twig will feed your fear.<br>Witness spooky paranormal events that will make you doubt your mind.<br>Enjoy the excitement of camaraderie as you depend on one another to prevail over what lies ahead in terms of challenges and horrors.<br><br><br>Beyond the haunting atmosphere and chilling encounters lies a crucial task: It is necessary to find a way out without being seen.<br><br>Together After Dark provides a memorable tour of horror enthusiasts who are looking for an exciting and bloody journey with their friends.<br><br>Key Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4-player co-op horror experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hauntingly beautiful and atmospheric environment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chilling paranormal encounters and jump scares</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unravel the dark secrets hidden within the forest</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you brave enough to face the darkness?</p>","developers":["RedForge"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2708790/header.jpg?t=1737334097","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2708790/711785/9fb2474c429e82b03b0f3cff396d9cee68a951de/1750893006/dash_av1.mpd?t=1735443797","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2708790/711785/9fb2474c429e82b03b0f3cff396d9cee68a951de/1750893006/dash_h264.mpd?t=1735443797","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2708790/711785/9fb2474c429e82b03b0f3cff396d9cee68a951de/1750893006/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1735443797","id":257029917,"name":"Together After Dark - Teaser","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2